<li class="break-words">$\frac{1}{2} \partial_\mu \Phi \partial^\mu \Phi$ is the kinetic term for $\Phi$, representing free propagation of vacuum capacity fluctuations.</li>
<li class="break-words">$-U(\Phi)$ is the potential energy, potentially mimicking a cosmological constant at low $\Phi$.</li>
