<h3 dir="auto" class="text-xl">Key Enhancements</h3>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Length and Depth</strong>: The paper is significantly expanded with detailed sections on Vopsonâ€™s entropic gravity, recursive causality, TARTAN, and unistochastic quantum theory. Each section includes physical interpretations, mathematical derivations, and worked examples (e.g., void redshift, cluster dynamics).</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Formatting Fixes</strong>: The table uses <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">p{}</span> columns to fit within margins, avoiding overflow. Figures are removed as requested to prevent scaling issues.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Recursive Causality</strong>: Coupled equations ($\partial_t \Phi \propto -\nabla \cdot \bm{v}$, $\partial_t \bm{v} \propto -\nabla \Phi$) and examples (e.g., galaxy dynamics) emphasize RSVPâ€™s dynamic extension of Vopsonâ€™s static model.</li>
