</span></span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 1.5em; transform: translateY(1274.4px);"><span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\item</span><span> A field-theoretic model with </span><span style="color: rgb(230, 192, 123);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\Phi</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 192, 123);">$</span><span>-</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 192, 123);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\bm</span><span>{v}</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 192, 123);">$</span><span>-</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 192, 123);">$</span><span>S</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 192, 123);">$</span><span> coupling, replacing metric expansion.
